<section data-mw-section-id="4" id="mwSA" aria-labelledby="Projective_space_as_moduli_of_very_ample_line_bundles_generated_by_global_sections"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading4"><h4 id="Projective_space_as_moduli_of_very_ample_line_bundles_generated_by_global_sections">Projective space as moduli of very ample line bundles generated by global sections</h4><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Moduli_space&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4" title="Edit section: Projective space as moduli of very ample line bundles generated by global sections"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div><p id="mwSQ">
