  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/e85ff03cbe0c7341af6b982e47e9f90d235c66ab" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.216ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle d}"/></span> homogeneous polynomial <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt62" id="mwrw" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"f"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle f}">
